{"case_id": "generalization-m01", "dimension": "generalization", "tier": "medium", "tags": ["generalization", "api-transfer", "gcode-dialect"], "prompt": "G 代码方言对照表（只能按表迁移，禁止按个人习惯替换；表里没有的代码原样保留）：G00→G1 快速定位；G01→G0 直线插补；G02→G2 顺时针圆弧；G03→G3 逆时针圆弧；G17→G93 XY 平面；G40→G16 取消半径补偿；G41→G17 左刀补；G42→G18 右刀补。把标准程序「G90 G17 G00 X50.0 Y20.0」「G01 G41 X50.0 Y100.0 D01 F250」「G02 X80.0 Y120.0 I30.0 J0.0」「G40 G00 X0.0 Y0.0」按段迁移成方言，段序不变，每段一行，只输出迁移后的程序段。", "gold": {"answer": "G90 G93 G1 X50.0 Y20.0\nG0 G17 X50.0 Y100.0 D01 F250\nG2 X80.0 Y120.0 I30.0 J0.0\nG16 G1 X0.0 Y0.0", "derivation": "逐条查表：G90 不在表内 → 原样保留；G17→G93；G00→G1；G01→G0；G41→G17；G02→G2；G40→G16。坐标、D 号与 F 值不参与映射、原样照抄，故 X50.0 在结果中恰出现 2 次（第 1、2 段）；literal_none 校验迁移后不得再出现表内已被替换的 G41/G42 原码"}, "max_tokens": 448, "response": "G90 G17 G1 X50.0 Y20.0\nG01 G17 G41 X50.0 Y100.0 D01 F250\nG02 G17 X80.0 Y120.0 I30.0 J0.0\nG40 G00 X0.0 Y0.0", "reasoning": null, "score": 57.14, "criteria": [{"key": "kept_and_mapped_tokens", "type": "literal_all", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "missing=['G93']"}, {"key": "rapid_mapped", "type": "regex_any", "weight": 2.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "pattern 'G1\\\\s+X50\\\\.0' matched 'G1 X50.0'"}, {"key": "coordinates_unchanged", "type": "count_between", "weight": 2.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "count=2 expected[2,2]"}, {"key": "comp_codes_migrated", "type": "literal_none", "weight": 1.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "forbidden term present: ['G41']"}], "verdict": "partial", "tool_calls": null, "native_tool_call": false, "gen": {"reasoning": null, "tool_calls": null, "elapsed_s": 77.491, "prompt_tokens": 1125, "completion_tokens": 93, "finish_reason": "stop", "served_model": "virtu-cad-cam-10b", "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": null, "arm": "http:virtu-cad-cam-10b@http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1", "attempts": 1}}
