{"case_id": "knowledge-m01", "dimension": "knowledge", "tier": "medium", "tags": ["general-tolerance", "standard-number"], "prompt": "图样技术要求里写着「ISO 2768-mK」，其中的 m 和 K 分别表示什么？", "gold": {"answer": "ISO 2768-mK 中，m 是 ISO 2768-1 规定的线性与角度尺寸一般公差的中等等级，K 是 ISO 2768-2 规定的几何公差（也叫形位公差）的 K 级。", "derivation": "标注形式为 ISO 2768-<尺寸公差等级><几何公差等级>：m 来自 ISO 2768-1 一般公差等级，K 来自 ISO 2768-2 几何公差等级（H、K、L）。"}, "max_tokens": 448, "response": "【机械制造常识】\nISO 2768-mK 中：\n- \"m\" 表示中等线性/角度尺寸公差；\n- \"K\" 表示几何形状公差等级为 K。", "reasoning": null, "score": 50.0, "criteria": [{"key": "m_class", "type": "regex_any", "weight": 3.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "pattern '中等' matched '中等'"}, {"key": "k_class", "type": "regex_any", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "no pattern matched among ['(?i)k[\\\\s]*级']"}, {"key": "k_scope", "type": "regex_any", "weight": 1.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "no pattern matched among ['几何公差', '形位公差', '(?i)geometrical']"}], "verdict": "partial", "tool_calls": null, "native_tool_call": false, "gen": {"reasoning": null, "tool_calls": null, "elapsed_s": 25.074, "prompt_tokens": 916, "completion_tokens": 53, "finish_reason": "stop", "served_model": "virtu-cad-cam-10b", "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": null, "arm": "http:virtu-cad-cam-10b@http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1", "attempts": 1}}
