{"case_id": "reasoning-e01", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "easy", "tags": ["reasoning", "cutting-speed"], "prompt": "已知公式 n=1000*Vc/(π*D)。某立铣刀直径 D=16 mm，推荐切削速度 Vc=120 m/min。只计算主轴转速 n，单位 r/min，结果保留 1 位小数，不要输出其他量。", "gold": {"answer": "n = 1000*120/(π*16) = 120000/50.2654824 = 2387.3 r/min", "derivation": "n=1000*Vc/(π*D)=1000*120/(3.14159265*16)=120000/50.2654824=2387.3241 r/min，按题干要求保留 1 位小数为 2387.3；tol_abs=0.05 用于覆盖末位四舍五入的 ±0.05"}, "max_tokens": 256, "response": "n = 1000 * 120 / (3.141592653589793 * 16) ≈ 2387.3 r/min", "reasoning": null, "score": 100.0, "criteria": [{"key": "rpm_value", "type": "numeric_near", "weight": 3.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "closest=2387.3 target=2387.3 tol=0.05 all=[1000.0, 120.0, 3.141592653589793, 16.0, 2387.3]"}, {"key": "rpm_unit", "type": "regex_any", "weight": 1.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "pattern 'r\\\\s*/\\\\s*min|rpm|转每分' matched 'r/min'"}, {"key": "no_decimal_shift", "type": "literal_none", "weight": 1.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "no forbidden term"}], "verdict": "pass", "tool_calls": null, "native_tool_call": false, "gen": {"reasoning": null, "tool_calls": null, "elapsed_s": 37.667, "prompt_tokens": 956, "completion_tokens": 52, "finish_reason": "stop", "served_model": "virtu-cad-cam-10b", "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": null, "arm": "http:virtu-cad-cam-10b@http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1", "attempts": 1}}
{"case_id": "reasoning-m01", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "medium", "tags": ["reasoning", "cutting-speed", "feed-rate"], "prompt": "铣削 Ø10 mm、3 齿立铣刀，Vc=200 m/min，每齿进给 f=0.15 mm/齿。按 n=1000*Vc/(π*D) 先算主轴转速并四舍五入到整数，再以取整后的 n 代入 Vf=f*z*n。按顺序给出 n（r/min）与 Vf（mm/min，保留 1 位小数）。", "gold": {"answer": "n = 1000*200/(π*10) = 6366.1977 → 取整 6366 r/min；Vf = 0.15*3*6366 = 2864.7 mm/min", "derivation": "n=200000/31.4159265=6366.1977，按题干取整为 6366；Vf=0.15*3*6366=2864.7 mm/min 精确值；tol_abs(n)=1 覆盖 6366/6366.2 两种表述，tol_abs(Vf)=0.3 覆盖用未取整 n 计算得到的 2864.79（差 0.09）"}, "max_tokens": 448, "response": "根据公式 $ n = \\frac{1000 \\times 200}{\\pi \\times 10} \\approx 6366.2$ r/min，取整后 $ n_{\\text{round}} = 6366 $ r/min；\n$$ V_f = 0.15 \\times 3 \\times 6366 = 2864.7 $$ mm/min；\n最终结果：\nn = 6366 r/min，\nVf = 2864.7 mm/min", "reasoning": null, "score": 100.0, "criteria": [{"key": "rpm_value", "type": "numeric_near", "weight": 2.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "closest=6366.0 target=6366.0 tol=1.0 all=[1000.0, 200.0, 10.0, 6366.2, 6366.0, 0.15, 3.0, 6366.0]"}, {"key": "vf_value", "type": "numeric_near", "weight": 3.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "closest=2864.7 target=2864.7 tol=0.3 all=[1000.0, 200.0, 10.0, 6366.2, 6366.0, 0.15, 3.0, 6366.0]"}, {"key": "chain_order", "type": "ordered_contains", "weight": 1.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "order preserved for 2 anchors"}], "verdict": "pass", "tool_calls": null, "native_tool_call": false, "gen": {"reasoning": null, "tool_calls": null, "elapsed_s": 52.923, "prompt_tokens": 995, "completion_tokens": 124, "finish_reason": "stop", "served_model": "virtu-cad-cam-10b", "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": null, "arm": "http:virtu-cad-cam-10b@http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1", "attempts": 1}}
{"case_id": "reasoning-h01", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "hard", "tags": ["reasoning", "cutting-chain", "mrr", "machining-time"], "prompt": "粗铣平面工艺链：刀具 Ø12 mm、齿数 z=4，Vc=180 m/min，每齿进给 f=0.15 mm/齿，ap=3 mm，ae=10 mm；单次走刀覆盖长度 480 mm，每层另加引入与切出空行程 20 mm，共 2 层。公式：n=1000*Vc/(π*D)，Vf=f*z*n，MRR=ap*ae*Vf，T=总行程/Vf。中间量一律不取整，最终 n、Vf 各保留 1 位小数，MRR 保留 1 位小数（mm³/min），时间保留 2 位小数（单位 s）。按 n、Vf、MRR、时间的顺序输出。", "gold": {"answer": "n = 1000*180/(π*12) = 4774.6 r/min；Vf = 0.15*4*n = 2864.8 mm/min；MRR = 3*10*Vf = 85943.7 mm³/min；总行程 = 2*(480+20) = 1000 mm；T = 1000/2864.789 = 0.349066 min = 20.94 s", "derivation": "n=180000/37.6991118=4774.64829；Vf=0.6*4774.64829=2864.78898→2864.8；MRR=30*2864.78898=85943.669→85943.7；总行程=2*500=1000 mm；T=1000/2864.78898=0.3490659 min，乘 60 得 20.94395 s→20.94 s。tol_abs：n 0.5 覆盖 4774.6/4774.65；Vf 0.2 覆盖取整 n 传下来的 2864.76；MRR 30 覆盖 85942.8~85944；时间 0.05 覆盖 20.94/20.944"}, "max_tokens": 704, "response": "根据提供的参数进行计算：\nn = 1000 * 180 / (π * 12) ≈ 4772.25 rpm\nVf = 0.15 * 4 * 4772.25 ≈ 3000.00 mm/min\nMRR = 3 * 10 * 3000.00 ≈ 90000.00 mm³/min\nT = (480 + 2 * 20 + 2 * 20)/3000.00 ≈ 0.06 min\n结果为：\nn≈4772.3 rpm\nVf≈3000.0 mm/min\nMRR≈90000.0 mm³/min\nT≈0.06 min\n\n[确定性核算] Vf = f·z·n = 0.15×4×4774.6 = 2864.8 mm/min；MRR = ap·ae·Vf = 3×10×2864.8 = 85943.7 mm³/min（以此为准）", "reasoning": null, "score": 66.67, "criteria": [{"key": "rpm_value", "type": "numeric_near", "weight": 2.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "closest=4774.6 target=4774.6 tol=0.5 all=[1000.0, 180.0, 12.0, 4772.25, 0.15, 4.0, 4772.25, 3000.0]"}, {"key": "vf_value", "type": "numeric_near", "weight": 2.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "closest=2864.8 target=2864.8 tol=0.2 all=[1000.0, 180.0, 12.0, 4772.25, 0.15, 4.0, 4772.25, 3000.0]"}, {"key": "mrr_value", "type": "numeric_near", "weight": 2.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "closest=85943.7 target=85943.7 tol=30.0 all=[1000.0, 180.0, 12.0, 4772.25, 0.15, 4.0, 4772.25, 3000.0]"}, {"key": "time_seconds", "type": "numeric_near", "weight": 3.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "closest=20.0 target=20.94 tol=0.05 all=[1000.0, 180.0, 12.0, 4772.25, 0.15, 4.0, 4772.25, 3000.0]"}], "verdict": "partial", "tool_calls": null, "native_tool_call": false, "gen": {"reasoning": null, "tool_calls": null, "elapsed_s": 36.163, "prompt_tokens": 1076, "completion_tokens": 193, "finish_reason": "stop", "served_model": "virtu-cad-cam-10b", "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": null, "arm": "http:virtu-cad-cam-10b@http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1", "attempts": 1}}
